<div>
  <%# <h1 class="font-bold text-4xl">StaticPages#about</h1> %>

  <h1>About</h1>

  <p>This application uses synthetic data generated with the Faker gem for the following tables:</p>

  <ul>
    <li><strong>Player:</strong> Stores information about individual players, including their jersey number, name, and the team they belong to.</li>
    <li><strong>Team:</strong> Contains details about different teams, including the names of players, team name, and the coach.</li>
    <li><strong>Trophy:</strong> Records information about various trophies, including the year it was awarded and the name of the trophy.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Entity-Relationship Diagram (ERD)</h2>
  <p>This ERD represents the relationships between the tables in my database:</p>

  <img src="/erd.png" alt="ERD Diagram" style="width:100%; max-width:600px;">

  <p>The relationships between these tables are as follows:</p>

  <h4><strong>Join Tables:</strong></h4>
  
  <ul>
    <li>players_trophies</li>
    <ul>
      <li>This join table facilitates the many-to-many relationship between players and trophies. It contains the foreign keys player_id and trophy_id to link players with trophies.</li>
    </ul>
    <li>teams_trophies</li>
    <ul>
      <li>This join table facilitates the many-to-many relationship between teams and trophies. It contains the foreign keys team_id and trophy_id to link teams with trophies.</li>
    </ul>
  </ul>

  <h4><strong>Relationships:</strong></h4>

  <ul>
    <li>Player-Teams Relationship</li>
    <ul>
      <li>One-to-Many: A team can have many players, but each player belongs to one team (Player belongs_to Team, Team has_many Players).</li>
    </ul>
    <li>Player-Trophies Relationship</li>
    <ul>
      <li>Many-to-Many: A player can win many trophies, and each trophy can be awarded to many players (Player has_and_belongs_to_many Trophies, Trophy has_and_belongs_to_many Players).</li>
    </ul>
    <li>Team-Trophies Relationship</li>
    <ul>
      <li>Many-to-Many: A team can win many trophies, and each trophy can be awarded to many teams (Team has_and_belongs_to_many Trophies, Trophy has_and_belongs_to_many Teams).</li>
    </ul>
  </ul>

  <p>Find me in app/views/static_pages/about.html.erb</p>
</div>
